{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghztrkk2nJy12MtVyhim","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clicking the 5th title card with the mouse opened HOW TO PLAY in a real browser, so menu hover and click work after the mouse fix. There were no console errors.\n\nI've now checked everything I can on the TASK.md features, and I can't make the remaining caveats go away:\n- **Online multiplayer:** TASK.md says to follow the AI Hub library. That README defines `parallel` as a valid mode, and my round passes the harness at 2 and 3 players, and at 4 players with latency and loss. Shared-world netcode was a PLAN.md choice, not a TASK.md requirement. I did not build it.\n- **Hands-on play:** I haven't played the game by hand on a real controller, and I can't listen to the audio. TASK.md only asks for headless testing and doesn't require hand play.\n- **Content cuts:** The plan's 6th crew, extra players, shorts and hair styles are not in. TASK.md doesn't list them.\n\nSo I'm not claiming the plan was met in full. The final reply with the four required sections is my previous message, and nothing about the game has changed since."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":784,"cache_read_input_tokens":383384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":784},"output_tokens":357,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"213edd46-9651-46f8-a282-da1d89430eab","uuid":"20129472-c0e1-4fa8-a667-f9357db1bb8c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:52:54.853Z","request_id":"req_011CghztrLw1fRL8SLdtukM1"}
