{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi17YVVgJr5M9XWY3Hy7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The game is complete as far as I can verify, and I have nothing more to build or check. The bundle and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder as before. The JSON parses with every field filled in, and the four sections are in my previous message.\n\nThe hook now agrees every artifact and every section is present. Its remaining objection is that I haven't proven \"every TASK.md feature\" beyond my own table. That table was written line by line from TASK.md.\n\n- **Cut items:** The plan's 6th crew, extra players, shorts, hair styles and shared-world netcode don't appear in TASK.md, so they aren't TASK.md features.\n- **Tests and browser checks:** 73 scripted checks pass, the AI Hub harness passes, and real-browser clicks confirmed the menus and the hover card.\n- **Not tested by me:** Hand play on a real controller and the audio. TASK.md doesn't require either.\n\nI can't strengthen this evidence without changing the game. If a specific TASK.md feature looks missing or broken to you, name it and I'll check it and fix it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2443,"cache_read_input_tokens":408102,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2443},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"213edd46-9651-46f8-a282-da1d89430eab","uuid":"d53544ff-1ae0-4f97-bd50-26002972f7cb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:55:47.015Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi17Y8BERzym615hnUFb"}
